    the last axis by default. Here's a batched 3-dimensional cross
    product, operating on the rows of the inputs:

    >>> a = jnp.array([[1, 2, 3],
    ...                [3, 4, 3]])
    >>> b = jnp.array([[2, 3, 2],
    ...                [4, 5, 6]])
